      "description": "<p>When a painted soldier uses a ranged Strike, the ammunition or weapon (if thrown) becomes a smear of paint. It deals damage normally, and a creature struck by it becomes Clumsy 1 and takes a –5-foot circumstance penalty to their Speed for 10 minutes. The paint can be removed with a total of 3 Interact actions by the creature or an adjacent ally.</p>\n<p>Effect: Matting Paint</p>",
